@startuml
title TMFS019AgreementManagement-Browse Catalog-2

box "Entity/Communication Service Provider\nEntity IT Systems (Solution)"
actor "CSP\nContract\nManager" as CSPManager
participant "Product Catalog" as CSPCatalog
end box
box "Supplier/Partner\nEntity IT Systems(Solution)"
participant "Engagement\nManagement" as EngMgmt
participant "Product\nCatalog" as SPCatalog
participant "Product\nConfigurator" as SPConfig
end box
actor "SP1\nContract\nManager" as SPManager
participant "PMCSP1" as PMCSP1

alt catalog browsing [CSP Initated]
CSPManager -> EngMgmt : 1 select a category
note right of EngMgmt : Alternatively TMF620 Product Catalog API\ncould be used directly to SP Product Catalog
EngMgmt -> SPCatalog : 2 TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt GET /productOffering\n(Category=x&B2b2XChannel=..)
SPCatalog --> EngMgmt : 3 TMF620 200 OK\nlist of productOffering
else eligible catalog browsing
EngMgmt -> SPConfig : 4 TMF679 Product Offering Qualification POST /productOfferingQualification\n(Category=x&commercial criteria)
SPConfig --> EngMgmt : 5 TMF679 201 Created\nlist of eligible productOffering
EngMgmt --> CSPManager : 6 TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt GET /productOffering\n(Category=x&SaleChannel=..)
else catalog Specification Retrieval
CSPManager -> EngMgmt : 7 Request Product Specification
EngMgmt -> SPCatalog : 8 Retrieve Product Specification
SPCatalog --> EngMgmt : 9 Provide Product Specification and examples
EngMgmt --> CSPManager : 10 Provide Product Specification
end
@enduml
